/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Category revenue fluctuates between $42.4K \(Q1\) and $61.0K \(Q7\), reflecting seasonal variations in demand. The number of total buyers ranges from ~20.5K in Q1 to ~29.7K in Q7, with corresponding buyer penetration \(b\) between 16% and 24%. Buyer purchase frequency \(w\) remains stable at around 1.3 purchases per buyer per quarter, indicating limited variation in purchase intensity.)
